  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORT FOR GAZA STRIP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IT AIMS AT ALLEVIATING THE PALESTINIAN POPULATION SUFFERING FROM OCCUPYING FORCES VICIOUS ATTACK ON THEIR PROPERTIES AND HOUSES. THIS WILL BE ACHIEVED THROUGH REHABILITATING AND RECONSTRUCTING THE DAMAGED PROPERTIES, BUILDINGS, HOUSES AND WORKSHOPS. THE PROJECT WILL ALSO REHABILITATE ESSENTIAL PHY. AND SOCIAL INFRASTRUCTURE SERVICES IN THE AFFECTED AREAS.</narrative>
  </description>
